----------------------------

Model weights are NOT included in this repository or the container image.
The downloader stages the pinned model on container disk.

  prithivMLmods/Gliese-Qwen3.5-9B-Abliterated-Caption
  https://huggingface.co/prithivMLmods/Gliese-Qwen3.5-9B-Abliterated-Caption
